<section class="surrender-open">

  <div class="shell surrender-open__grid">

    <div>

      <p class="eyebrow">
        Surrender request
      </p>

      <h1>
        Tell us what is happening.
      </h1>

      <p>
        If you need to discuss surrendering a cat, use the form below to share the situation. We know this can be difficult, and the information helps the volunteer team understand your request.
      </p>

    </div>


    <p class="surrender-open__aside">
      Submitting a request does not mean Feline Fairies can accept a cat. Please wait for a response before making any arrangements.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="surrender-info">

  <div class="shell surrender-info__grid">

    <h2>
      Before you submit
    </h2>

    <ul>

      <li>
        Share accurate details about the cat and your circumstances.
      </li>

      <li>
        Include how the team can reach you for follow-up.
      </li>

      <li>
        The rescue’s ability to help depends on current capacity and circumstances.
      </li>

    </ul>

  </div>

</section>



<section class="form-layout">

  <div class="shell">

    <div class="form-layout__heading">

      <div>

        <p class="eyebrow">
          Official request form
        </p>

        <h2>
          Send your information.
        </h2>

      </div>

      <p>
        This form is provided by Feline Fairies through Jotform.
      </p>

    </div>


    {% set formConfig = forms.surrender %}
    {% set formSize = "long" %}
    {% include "components/form-embed.njk" %}

  </div>

</section>



<section class="surrender-next">

  <div class="shell">

    <p class="eyebrow">
      After submitting
    </p>

    <h2>
      The team will review your request.
    </h2>

    <p>
      A volunteer may contact you for more information or to discuss what may be possible. For a general question, please use the
      <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.
      This form is not an emergency service.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>